  "description": "<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\"> </div>\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<article class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&:has([data-writing-block])>*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:9aa04197-2783-4093-a7bb-911058decbde-80\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-158\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"8c0bd5c0-4a6b-4e84-9f34-1cc8ea4bbdad\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-2\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word dark markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"70\" data-end=\"357\">De Planet Eclipse 08 Ego is een hoogwaardige en professionele paintball marker die bekendstaat om zijn betrouwbaarheid, precisie en snelle schietprestaties. Deze marker is ontworpen voor fanatieke spelers en toernooigebruik, met een robuuste constructie en uitstekende lucht-efficiëntie.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"359\" data-end=\"462\">Deze marker verkeert in <strong data-start=\"383\" data-end=\"401\">In Nette Staat</strong> en is technisch volledig functioneel. Inclusief accessoires.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"464\" data-end=\"495\">Korte productbeschrijving</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"496\" data-end=\"618\">Een professionele paintball marker met hoge vuursnelheid en uitstekende nauwkeurigheid, geschikt voor competitief gebruik.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"620\" data-end=\"631\">Staat</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"632\" data-end=\"703\"><strong data-start=\"632\" data-end=\"650\">In Nette Staat</strong> – Normale gebruikssporen mogelijk, 100% functioneel.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"720\">⭐ Voordelen</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"721\" data-end=\"910\">\r\n<li data-start=\"721\" data-end=\"751\">\r\n<p data-start=\"723\" data-end=\"751\">🎯 Zeer nauwkeurig en snel</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"796\">\r\n<p data-start=\"754\" data-end=\"796\">🔫 Geschikt voor toernooien en speedball</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"797\" data-end=\"840\">\r\n<p data-start=\"799\" data-end=\"840\">⚙️ Betrouwbare Planet Eclipse kwaliteit</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"841\" data-end=\"881\">\r\n<p data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"881\">🪶 Lichtgewicht en goed gebalanceerd</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"910\">\r\n<p data-start=\"884\" data-end=\"910\">📦 Inclusief accessoires</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"932\">📋 Specificaties</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"933\" data-end=\"1104\">\r\n<li data-start=\"933\" data-end=\"959\">\r\n<p data-start=\"935\" data-end=\"959\">Type: Paintball marker</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"960\" data-end=\"992\">\r\n<p data-start=\"962\" data-end=\"992\">Model: Planet Eclipse 08 Ego</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1021\">\r\n<p data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1021\">Aandrijving: Lucht / HPA</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1022\" data-end=\"1061\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1061\">Geschikt voor: Speedball / toernooi</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1062\" data-end=\"1078\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1078\">Kleur: Bruin</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1079\" data-end=\"1104\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1104\">Staat: In Nette Staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1124\">📦 Meegeleverd</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1181\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1157\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1127\" data-end=\"1157\">Planet Eclipse 08 Ego marker</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1158\" data-end=\"1181\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1181\">Diverse accessoires</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1183\" data-end=\"1207\">🛡️ Incl. Garantie</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1244\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1244\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Incl. Garantie: 3 maand garantie</strong></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"> </div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</article>\r\n</div>",
